{"code":0,"data":{"title":"统一收单查询接口","content":"<h1 id=\"s-03l5h9ah\">一、接口说明</h1><p>vivopay.trade.query.v2（统一收单交易查询接口_v2）</p><p>该接口提供支付平台支付订单的查询，商户可以通过主动调用该接口查询订单状态，支付结果处理需在成功获取接口响应后进行判断，完成下一步的业务逻辑。</p><h1 id=\"s-ehiffn1a\"><br>二、接口请求</h1><p>请求地址： https://openpay.vivo.com.cn/gateway</p><p>Headers：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"181\" style=\"width: 181px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"348\" style=\"width: 348px\"><p><strong>参数值</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"121\" style=\"width: 121px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"181\" style=\"width: 181px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Content-Type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"348\" style=\"width: 348px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>application/x-www-form-urlencoded</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"121\" style=\"width: 121px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-4xcfvumy\">1、公共参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"148\" style=\"width: 148px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"264\" style=\"width: 264px\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"561\" style=\"width: 561px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>version</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"148\" style=\"width: 148px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"264\" style=\"width: 264px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1.0.0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"561\" style=\"width: 561px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】接口版本号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"148\" style=\"width: 148px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"264\" style=\"width: 264px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivopay.trade.query.v2</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"561\" style=\"width: 561px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】接口服务名称</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"148\" style=\"width: 148px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"264\" style=\"width: 264px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>2019002536451112</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"561\" style=\"width: 561px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】应用编号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"148\" style=\"width: 148px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"264\" style=\"width: 264px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20180724030750</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"561\" style=\"width: 561px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】发送请求的时间，格式：yyyyMMddHH