l对象为 VivopayTradeQueryV2Model</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2 id=\"s-84y3woow\">2、业务参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" style=\"width: 150px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"266\" style=\"width: 266px\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"564\" style=\"width: 564px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>merchantOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" style=\"width: 150px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"266\" style=\"width: 266px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20190316154879313465</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"564\" style=\"width: 564px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【业务请求参数】商户订单号，和tradeOrderNo二者必须传一个</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"183\" style=\"width: 183px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" style=\"width: 150px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"98\" style=\"width: 98px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"266\" style=\"width: 266px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20190316444579879461153464</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"564\" style=\"width: 564px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【业务请求参数】vivo交易流水号，和merchantOrderNo二者必须传一个</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 id=\"s-8200buwf\"><br>三、响应参数</h1><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"180\" style=\"width: 180px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"151\" style=\"width: 151px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"473\" style=\"width: 473px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"180\" style=\"width: 180px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"151\" style=\"width: 151px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>必须</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"473\" style=\"width: 473px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回码 附录5</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"180\" style=\"width: 180px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"151\" style=\"width: 151px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>必须</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"473\" style=\"width: 473px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回码描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"180\" style=\"width: 180px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bizCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"151\" style=\"width: 151px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"101\" style=\"width: 101px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>必须</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"473\" style=\"width: 473px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>业务返回码，S=成功 附录4</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"180\" style=\"width: 180px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bizMsg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"151\" style=\"width: 15